{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2007-deet-science2-12","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2007,"subject":"chemistry","number":12,"points":null,"unitId":"electro","unitLabel":"산화·환원·전기화학","topic":"전극·전기분해","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["electro","stoich"],"stem":"그림은동일한모양과같은크기의Cu 전극A～D를사용하여\n만든전기분해실험장치를나타낸것이다.\nA, B는C, D보다\nCuSO4 수용액속에더많이잠겨있다.\n일정시간동안전기분해가일어나도록하였을때, 이에대한\n설명으로옳은것을<보기>에서모두고른것은? (단, 산화와\n환원에관여하는것은Cu와Cu2＋뿐이며, 석출된Cu는모두해당\n전극에부착된다.)\n<보기>\nㄱ. A의질량은증가하고, D의질량은감소한다.\nㄴ. B와C 각각의질량은변화가없다.\nㄷ. A와D 각각의질량변화량절대값은서로같다.\n1\nㄹ. A의Cu 몰수변화량절대값은이동한전자몰수의\n2 이다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t016"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄱ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t017"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t018"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t019"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t020"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":595,"height":538,"region":0,"bbox":[45.256,71.668,238.0,215.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2007-deet-science2-12/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":772,"height":228,"region":0,"bbox":[14.456,390.468,308.8,91.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2007-deet-science2-12/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":5,"sourceRect":[82.744,152.732,416.5,682.715],"width":333.756,"height":529.983,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[45.256,71.668,238.0,215.2],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[14.456,390.468,308.8,91.2],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"text","text":"12. 그림은동일한모양과같은크기의Cu 전극A～D를사용하여","bbox":[5.0,5.0,318.54,11.995],"spans":[{"text":